OL,3,GNEWSAArmed police train for an attack
OL,4,Aon nuclear shipment from Dounreay
OL,5,
OL,6,FArmed police have for the first time
OL,7,Ftested a scenario where an attempt is
OL,8,Fmade to attack and steal a shipment of
OL,9,Fradioactive material being transported
OL,10,Ffrom the Dounreay nuclear power plant.
OL,12,FThe Civil Nuclear Constabulary exercise
OL,13,Finvolved armed attackers deliberately
OL,14,Fcrashing a car to stop a lorry reaching
OL,15,FGeorgemas Junction, a railway station
OL,16,Fabout six miles from the plant on the
OL,17,Fnorth Caithness coast.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
