OL,3,GNEWSAArmed police train for an attack
OL,4,Aon nuclear shipment from Dounreay
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn real-life situations, the station
OL,7,Fhas been used for transporting
OL,8,Fradioactive material from Dounreay to
OL,9,FSellafield in Cumbria for reprocessing
OL,10,For storage.
OL,12,FThe training exercise included an
OL,13,Femployee at Dounreay, near Thurso,
OL,14,Fbeing "arrested" in connection with the
OL,15,Fattack.
